“My Giant Metal Puppy” (15 seconds — adorable & comedic)

GLOBAL STYLE

Dieselpunk but wholesomely cute
Rounder shapes, soft painterly edges
Gentle wobble physics (like a happy dog)
Brighter palette, soft morning light
Camera always moving softly, like a documentary following a misbehaving pet

MECH BEHAVIOR ANIMATION

Tail-like antenna wagging
Happy stomps
Excited toe taps
Head-tilts
Tiny “chirp-beeps” instead of scary noises

📽️ 15-SECOND VIDEO SCRIPT
(0.0–1.0s) — COLD OPEN: “BAD MECH!”

Wide shot: the mech is tiptoeing away comically with massive exaggerated careful steps, trying not to be noticed.

SFX: soft “clank… clank… clank…?”
Antenna wags like a tail.

(1.0–3.0s) — OWNER CALLS OUT

Owner (off-screen):
“Don’t you sneak off again!”

Camera snap-zooms as the mech FREEZES mid-step, leg up like a guilty puppy caught on the couch.

A tiny headlight blinks twice: “uh-oh.”

(3.0–5.0s) — THE PUPPY HEAD TILT

Mech lowers its foot slowly…
then tilts its entire cabin dome to the side like a curious dog hearing a funny noise.

Antenna wiggles.
Loose bolts jingle like a collar.

SFX: cute servo “wrrr?”

(5.0–7.5s) — “COME HERE!”

Owner (now visible, hands on hips):
“Come here, big guy.”

Mech instantly perks up.
Two bright lights turn on like excited eyes.
Steam puff bursts like a “tail wag.”

(7.5–10.0s) — HAPPY METAL PUPPY RUN

The mech gallops toward the owner with adorable clumsy enthusiasm.

Legs lift too high

Metal plates wobble

A tiny dangling bucket swings wildly

The top antenna wags in circles like a helicopter

SFX: big happy stomps “THUMP-thUMP-THUMP!”
Plus cute chirpy beeps.

Owner steps back:
“Whoa— easy! EASY!”

(10.0–12.5s) — FULL-BODY CUDDLE ATTEMPT

The mech tries to “nuzzle” the owner with its giant metal cabin.

Owner is pushed back by a gentle-but-enormous metal head boop.

Owner (laughing):
“You're not a lap dog!”

Mech lets out a soft foghorn “mwooof!”

(12.5–14.0s) — ROLLING OVER??

The mech suddenly drops to one knee, rolls slightly, and exposes its armored underside—

—it wants belly rubs.

All 3 legs flail playfully.

Dust cloud poofs like a happy dog shaking sand.

(14.0–15.0s) — END CARD

Cut to a dusty sign planted in the ground, wobbling from the commotion:

“GIANT PETS ARE HIGH MAINTENANCE.”

The mech’s massive metal paw gently taps the sign, as if saying “good boy?”

Fade out with a cute metal “ding.”